<title>USA: Metrowerks can't explain shr price drop.</title>
<headline>Metrowerks can't explain shr price drop.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metrowerks Inc, which provides software development tools, said on Thursday it had no material unannounced news which would explain the recent decline in its stock price.</p>
</text>
